WEBVTT

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:04.070
Begin Surfacing

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:15.140
Right here.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:36.630
It's a place I never thought I'd sit again.

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:48.030
It's like the type I used in simulations.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.000
How about here?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.700
They snuck around us! They're already on the beach on this side!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.140
Hey!

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:44.390
What happened?

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.000
Wait!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.450
Looks like they realized!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:01.340
Shall we cook them up first?

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:02.500
No.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.810
The transport ship comes first.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:08.650
Zilba!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:18.590
Let's go!

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:19.680
Yeah.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.150
All ready here.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.430
You... wait!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.310
Damn it!

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.100
Running away? Cowards!

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:43.260
We have to tell Kaoru and everyone
that they're headed their way.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:44.500
Luna!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:45.890
Luna...

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.360
Adam...

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:54.550
The escaped prisoners are heading your way.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.050
Adam!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:02.950
Luna?

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.550
Huh? The escaped prisoners? This way?

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:08.460
What's wrong?

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:14.280
I heard Luna's voice! She said the escaped prisoners are heading this way!

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:17.500
We have to tell Kaoru and everyone!

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.350
Hello! Can you hear me?

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.200
The escaped prisoners are on their way here!

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:27.180
What?

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:29.910
Mr. Porte!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.200
If we don't hurry, they'll be on top 'a us!

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.660
I know!

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.560
Here they are.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.980
I've just confirmed their location on the monitor!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.560
They'll be here any second!

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:54.290
What's your situation?

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:55.940
I can't take my hands off here.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:06:00.290
Shingo, transmit my words through
the communicator on the wall.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.140
Communicator?

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:06.510
Just a little longer.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.380
Start the engines so we can lift off as soon as possible.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.760
We'll be finished soon, so start up the main power unit.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.110
Roger that.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:22.680
Starting main power unit!

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.630
We're screwed if we don't hurry!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:49.230
This is my limit! I'll break apart!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.880
Hang in there 'til me make it to the ship!

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.580
I don't care how, just speed up!

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:54.850
Screw you!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.850
I hope nobody gives me flak for this one.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.930
They're almost there!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.780
Hurry!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.690
Everyone...

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.890
Alright! Installation complete!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:17.240
Shingo!

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:21.960
Installation of the Gyrostabilizer system is complete!

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.610
Start surfacing the ship!

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.430
Aye! Beginning surfacing!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.900
We made it!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.610
It's no use!

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:58.750
Head for the emergency hatch!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.440
What?

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:02.580
Why shouldn't we go in through the front door?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:08.050
They'll already have changed the password on
the main hatch and locked it from the inside!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:12.060
What do we do if they've already changed
the emergency hatch password too?

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:13.680
We'll have to risk it!

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:14.760
Go!

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:18.210
Easy for you to say! Don't blame me if we don't make it!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.780
Let's go... together.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.360
We won't make it!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.360
Calm down, Kaoru!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:26.650
Louis...

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.090
Lend me your strength.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.000
Hurry!

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.510
Just like I figured.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.130
The password is the same as before.

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.100
It's started surfacing!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.780
They did it! They did it! It's fixed, it's fixed!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:20.800
Where are they?

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.910
I can't tell from here.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.890
Head for the cockpit.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.730
I won't suffer them any more.

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.260
We'll kill the lot of them!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:31.790
Damn it!

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.560
They're on board! Watch out!

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:35.730
What did you say?

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.390
Geezer!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:42.440
Die!

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.750
It's useless no matter how many you shoot!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.650
It don't work on me, so give it up!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.860
Don't be so full of yourself!

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:05.690
This way!

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:10.000
Out of ammo!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.210
Hey!

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:15.740
What happened?

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.300
They'll be there in a moment!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:36.930
They shouldn't be able to open this lock from the outside.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.580
Maybe, but he's so stupidly strong...

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.390
...he'll just break straight through!

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.750
What do we do?

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.860
There's no chance of us winning if we fight here.

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:53.390
Is there anythin' we can use as a weapon?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.310
It's possible, but it'd still be pointless!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.690
We'll only have one chance to get out of here.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.130
Follow my directions.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:10.600
He did it!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.040
Now!

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:19.000
Damn them!

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:22.340
Hey, who's piloting the ship?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:26.950
It's on autopilot. Leave this to me. Follow them!

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.490
Like I'd have to be told!

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.410
I'll crush them!

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.290
Damn brats!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.330
Look for things we can use as weapons.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.230
It's Mr. Porte and everyone!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.600
It's the brats!

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:58.750
You think you can win a fight with us?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.500
I'll teach these boys a dance.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:08.310
A beautiful dance of fear, suffering, and writing in pain!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.500
The rest of you, stand back.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.910
Leave short 'n stout here to me.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.540
Chako! Will you be okay?

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:21.890
No sweat!

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.890
An old-fashioned robot pet?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:29.090
I may be old-fashioned, but my
claws are made of hyper-ceramic.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.210
Even steel...

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.250
...is no match!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.350
Damn you!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:54.960
Even if you try makin' scary eyes,
I ain't scared a bit.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:13.190
This is fun!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:15.890
Take that!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.170
Let go, let go!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:28.300
Didn't you say even steel was
no match for those claws?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.360
I'm just a girl.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.840
My nails just extend for show.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.280
Well isn't that a shame.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.840
It hurts!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:42.590
Even for a robot, this is bad news!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:43.750
Chako!

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:13.860
Adam, stay here in hiding.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.160
Let go!

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:26.500
Shall I have you perform the dance of terror?

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:27.590
Stop it!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.810
We give in! Use the ship as you like!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.960
Unfortunately, that won't satisfy me.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:34.940
Wait!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.640
I'll be your opponent!

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:49.860
She's trembling so much it's cute!

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:52.860
Bob, since she asked so nicely, be her opponent.

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.040
S-s-stay away!

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:16.450
Don't underestimate my power!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.440
You wounded my precious face!

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:48.660
I'm done playing! I'll kill you with one shot!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.500
Run away!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.950
Please!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.110
Stop it!

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.830
Go over there!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:24.060
Crap! That's highly flammable!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.110
Run!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:34.860
Adam!

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.540
Sharla, you get over here too!

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.610
Step on the left pedal!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:39.360
Right!

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:49.410
This is bad! At this rate the reactor will blow up too!

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.810
This ship is done for!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.010
What?

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:54.550
Run for it!

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.780
Everyone, get on the power loader!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.600
Mr. Porte, hurry!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:16.490
Got it, Kaoru? Fly as far away as you can!

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:17.800
Got it!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.110
Hurry!

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.750
I won't let you escape!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:40.260
Yeah, kill them! Don't think you can
get away with putting a scar on my face!

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:41.910
Don't worry about me!

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.690
Escape!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.140
Mr. Porte!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:54.780
Sharla!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.350
Set the output to full!

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:19.640
It's Kaoru and everyone!

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.830
What's going on?

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:33.960
Damn geezer!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.360
How do you plan to weasel your way out of this one?

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.030
With this!

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.500
My specially made bomb!

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.840
Try hurting me even a little!

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.650
KABOOM!

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.140
I'll drag you to hell with me!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:52.940
How about it?

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:55.150
What's wrong, Bob?

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.060
Damn it!

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:04.410
Idiots! They fell for my bluff!

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:10.530
I need a parachute!

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:16.900
What happened?

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:19.410
What exploded?

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:22.340
This ship is done for!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.300
Aren't there any emergency escape pods?

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.110
The geezer made them all useless.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.630
Raise the nose cone! We're falling!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.660
It's no use!

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:44.880
Damn it!

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.060
This should do it.

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:34.490
What?

00:22:45.810 --> 00:22:47.090
Mr. Porte!

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:05.200
Somehow, Mr. Porte made it out okay.

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:09.360
But we lost the transport ship and the ruins at the same time!

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:12.700
What a shock, when our hopes had been so high.

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:15.660
But we can't give up hope yet!

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:17.200
There's still the mainland.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:18.060
How will we get there?

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:19.790
Things'll work out somehow!

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:21.510
Optimistic as ever.

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:24.140
Ah well, that's your best feature.

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:29.500
Next time: Go to the mainland?!
